dl 23 is around Medusa, so you are near the castle and therefore
Gehennom. There are no aligned-altars in Gehennom and you cannot (and
shouldn't try) to convert a non-aligned altar.
So, probably no more convertable altars, but you can always use one of
the Gehennom altars for BUC testing (the first altar is on Gehennom
first level).

> So what is the best course of action in this particular predicament I
> find myself in? I realize that I can convert the level 1 chaotic altar
> but how painful will that be to go all the way to level 1 to determine
> whether an item is blessed or uncursed.

You have 3 choices:
1 - you go to DL1 and convert the altar (which should be pretty easy);
2 - you happen to have a blessed scroll of remove curse, and use it to
create holy water: reading a blessed ?oRC while confused blesses and
curses items randomly on your inventory;
3 - you keep going with what you have.

> And out of curiosity, what does one usually do if he/she cannot find a
